      "number": 119123,
      "title": "Allow shader containers to be loaded in parallel.",
      "url": "https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119123",
      "upstream_merge_sha": "9700abd3ba77ac3b9119c1bf4cd6e2a8570d4916",
      "audit_priority": "high",
      "status": "deferred",
      "reason": "Paired shader-cache concurrency change: upstream asynchronous cache loading lacks the current synchronous source-recompile fallback on failed shader creation and overwrites failed placeholder RIDs with null. Requires recovery/ownership adaptation and concurrent GPU cache validation. Current shader_create_from_bytecode_with_samplers retains its driver-call mutex, so the Metal race is not introduced here."
